## Class: Admitted JSON Schema Docs Crate Macro


One high-level macro declaring an optional JSON Schema bridge crate whose schema-backed configuration can only govern runtime behavior after star-toml admission, generated documentation, receipt binding, and release verification.


**Identifier**: `https://w3id.org/star-toml/macro#AdmittedJsonSchemaDocsCrateMacro`

