## Class: Schema Admission Macro


Declare that schema definitions must stand before config instances can stand.


**Identifier**: `https://w3id.org/star-toml/macro#SchemaAdmissionMacro`

---

## Class: JSON Schema Bridge Macro


Declare JSON Schema as a public shape source that must pass star-toml admission before standing.


**Identifier**: `https://w3id.org/star-toml/macro#JsonSchemaBridgeMacro`

---

## Class: Generated Configuration Documentation Macro


Declare that admitted config law must generate readable and machine-readable documentation with standing.


**Identifier**: `https://w3id.org/star-toml/macro#GeneratedConfigDocsMacro`

---

## Class: Receipt Macro


A macro that declares required provenance and digest bindings.


**Identifier**: `https://w3id.org/star-toml/macro#ReceiptMacro`

---

## Class: Projection Macro


A macro that declares generated documentation, metadata, LSP, or release-report projections.


**Identifier**: `https://w3id.org/star-toml/macro#ProjectionMacro`

---

## Class: Standing Macro


A macro that declares the predicates required for standing.


**Identifier**: `https://w3id.org/star-toml/macro#StandingMacro`

---

## Class: Feature-Flagged Crate Profile


A capability profile for an optional crate or feature boundary.


**Identifier**: `https://w3id.org/star-toml/macro#FeatureFlaggedCrateProfile`

